cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenSpectrum-VN: An open-source platform for neurodiversity-affirming autism support and single-case experimental design research in Vietnam"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenSpectrum-VN Contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rylaispirit/openspectrum-vn"
abstract: >-
  An open-source monorepo for Vietnamese families, inclusive-education teachers
  and researchers: a Vietnamese AAC board (ARASAAC pictograms), A-B-C functional
  behaviour logs, draft IEPs aligned with Circular 03/2018/TT-BGDDT, deterministic
  single-case effect sizes (NAP, Tau-U, PEM, PND, PAND, IRD, BC-SMD), inter-observer
  agreement (Cohen's kappa), on-device pose coding and FAIR de-identified export.
  Research prototype; not a medical device.
keywords:
  - autism
  - neurodiversity
  - augmentative and alternative communication
  - single-case experimental design
  - Tau-U
  - inter-observer agreement
  - FAIR data
  - Vietnam
